blog-line--center\">降雨量和日照</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">风和温差</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">虫害和霉菌</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">该如何培育葡萄树</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">花费大量心力</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">经过数年</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">倾注感情培育长大</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6288826/002-c15eceb025.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6288826/002-c15eceb025.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n充满爱意的葡萄们！又甜又好吃！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">葡萄受到悉心呵护</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">也就能明白它的价值有多高了！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">而且这次</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">他们还特别让我看了采摘机器（？）</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">帅得像是要变形了！\n\n<br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6288826/004-0ab19bf908.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6288826/004-0ab19bf908.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"