ss=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">每年也会分析葡萄</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">改变混合葡萄的种类</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">一点点构筑出当年的最佳风味</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">“科学的力量真厉害啊”</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">不过</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">能够预先看清几年后的情况</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">并创造出成品的匠人也很厉害！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">葡萄酒</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">只有当年在那片葡萄园里收获的葡萄</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">所能酿出的那么多</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6288826/008-418b3b7929.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6288826/008-418b3b7929.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">也就是说，一旦被买走</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">就会逐渐减少</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">结果</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">越受欢迎、消费得越多</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">价格就会越高</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"